    "atom::36ef6eb9c45101f002144b70": {
      "atom_id": "atom::36ef6eb9c45101f002144b70",
      "source_handle": "P0081",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效，但现有研究在暴露定义、混杂因素调整和结果上存在巨大异质性和冲突。本研究旨在量化三种主要干扰肠道微生物组的药物干预（抗生素、PPIs、益生菌）对ICI治疗结局的整体影响方向、 magnitude 及其异质性来源，为临床合理用药提供综合证据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cfd720a60726f8527337227ce6718295b9e92c9d29dad97e90dd74536cdbcfec",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::906aa19e46647370a9f64e800472d5db5546af60e5886aaf52eff77028d33b5e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c7a5b216f2a653e3c8c17e79029af003fc9e2d3f3498080e6157878d124f90ca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::309c1c34d8fe5e05a741d535": {
      "atom_id": "atom::309c1c34d8fe5e05a741d535",
      "source_handle": "P0081",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "针对接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗的实体瘤患者，系统评估三种常见伴随用药（抗生素、质子泵抑制剂PPIs、益生菌）对肠道微生物组及ICI疗效的影响。研究涵盖非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）、黑色素瘤、肾细胞癌（RCC）、尿路上皮癌（UC）、肝细胞癌（HCC）等多种肿瘤类型，纳入69项研究、102个队列，共22,568名患者。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cfd720a60726f8527337227ce6718295b9e92c9d29dad97e90dd74536cdbcfec",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::906aa19e46647370a9f64e800472d5db5546af60e5886aaf52eff77028d33b5e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::dbc142c37378929eeef17948d8e0a447a67bb92311647370abf60d0ee9a3c813",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::af9db2c3e08653de63a7ff47": {
      "atom_id": "atom::af9db2c3e08653de63a7ff47",
      "source_handle": "P0081",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇基于PRISMA指南的系统综述与Meta分析，旨在解决当前关于肠道微生物组调节剂影响ICI疗效的证据碎片化问题。作者通过检索PubMed、Embase等数据库，筛选出观察性研究（主要为回顾性队列），提取了进展无生存期（PFS）、总生存期（OS）和客观缓解率（ORR）数据。研究采用随机效应或固定效应模型计算合并风险比（HR/RR），并依据肿瘤类型、药物暴露时间窗（如[-90, 90]天）和治疗方案（单药vs联合）进行亚组分析。同时，利用Meta回归探索异质性来源，并通过GRADE系统评估证据确定性。结果显示，抗生素和PPIs的使用与ICI疗效降低显著相关，而益生菌补充则显示出改善疗效的趋势，但证据强度存在差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cfd720a60726f8527337227ce6718295b9e92c9d29dad97e90dd74536cdbcfec",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::906aa19e46647370a9f64e800472d5db5546af60e5886aaf52eff77028d33b5e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e53fee8656f559eaca846846b67843bd758eb00886c0a584e8ee3df2ad29d14d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::0360cf62ba518324dc8d8d89": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0360cf62ba518324dc8d8d89",
      "source_handle": "P0081",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该Meta分析为综述提供了关于‘伴随用药’这一关键混杂因素或调节变量的大规模实证数据。它不直接揭示微生物组机制，但确立了临床实践中必须控制的药物干扰类型及其对预后的量化影响。可用于综述中讨论‘外部干预如何掩盖或修饰微生物组-免疫互作信号’，以及‘为何单纯检测微生物组而不考虑用药史会导致结果不一致’。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cfd720a60726f8527337227ce6718295b9e92c9d29dad97e90dd74536cdbcfec",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::906aa19e46647370a9f64e800472d5db5546af60e5886aaf52eff77028d33b5e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b980c246197ea318b395a85e502b286bc806c0ba0dd37c75afb7d7d0d23dbb98",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f6c158ec0f2fe35057685e79": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f6c158ec0f2fe35057685e79",
      "source_handle": "P0081",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅反映统计学关联，不能证明因果机制；益生菌的结果基于较少研究且证据等级较低，不宜作为强证据引用；未区分具体细菌物种的变化。",
        "contribution": "提供了抗生素、PPIs和益生菌对ICI疗效影响的汇总效应量（HR/RR）。具体数据显示抗生素和PPIs显著降低OS、PFS和ORR，而益生菌显著改善这些指标。这有助于解释在观察微生物组与ICI疗效关系时，为何不同研究间存在巨大差异——因为患者群体的用药背景不同。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cfd720a60726f8527337227ce6718295b9e92c9d29dad97e90dd74536cdbcfec",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::906aa19e46647370a9f64e800472d5db5546af60e5886aaf52eff77028d33b5e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ca7c3a6066cb1f5725c92425143dfa2d5546a87fd1576a914d29d06838dc4811",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::7237db16c6d6800980fd3bbc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7237db16c6d6800980fd3bbc",
      "source_handle": "P0081",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于支持‘临床用药史是微生物组-ICI疗效关联中的关键混杂因素’这一论点；提供具体的效应大小参考，说明药物干扰的严重程度。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cfd720a60726f8527337227ce6718295b9e92c9d29dad97e90dd74536cdbcfec",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::906aa19e46647370a9f64e800472d5db5546af60e5886aaf52eff77028d33b5e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::903e4596937214e7ec74dbea065accc5e2a5ac40b9ac3d6b7ff42648c54881d6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::09085cf9b98d37186473847c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::09085cf9b98d37186473847c",
      "source_handle": "P0081",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "时间窗定义在不同原始研究中可能存在差异，合并分析依赖于作者的重新分类。",
        "contribution": "揭示了药物暴露的时间窗特异性：在ICI治疗前后[-45, 45]天内使用抗生素或PPIs，对预后的负面影响最为显著。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cfd720a60726f8527337227ce6718295b9e92c9d29dad97e90dd74536cdbcfec",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::906aa19e46647370a9f64e800472d5db5546af60e5886aaf52eff77028d33b5e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ca7c3a6066cb1f5725c92425143dfa2d5546a87fd1576a914d29d06838dc4811",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::73a96c356bd7aaaccc8e1d62": {
      "atom_id": "atom::73a96c356bd7aaaccc8e1d62",
      "source_handle": "P0081",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中讨论‘干预时机’的重要性，提示在评估微生物组影响时，需精确界定暴露时间窗，而非笼统地考虑‘是否用过药’。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cfd720a60726f8527337227ce6718295b9e92c9d29dad97e90dd74536cdbcfec",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
