    "atom::c639e42354a476a6bd96bf36": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c639e42354a476a6bd96bf36",
      "source_handle": "P0402",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述的证据基础主要是回顾性观察性研究，因此其发现的‘关联’不等于‘因果’。在将其用于支持因果机制时，必须明确标注这是基于观察性数据的假设，而非确证。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7430a2905f12e77c8007a96c52a2f5e12d1cecdc9c24bbefdc28df0f5caa88c2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c7253f3ae5ff410c4511abb7d0a5a927eddf8148feaae5ab344687284ccc86b5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b3615c2b69ee578a4f4486c1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b3615c2b69ee578a4f4486c1",
      "source_handle": "P0402",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "不同研究对‘抗生素暴露’的定义（时间窗口、累积剂量、类别）存在显著异质性，直接比较或合并效应大小时需谨慎，需注意方法学差异带来的偏差。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7430a2905f12e77c8007a96c52a2f5e12d1cecdc9c24bbefdc28df0f5caa88c2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
