      "variant_group": "field::a2a83bddb57d67e3b7a1223a9363420aeadaa65781c3554bf9c7ecae9dc4d2e4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9b8a520e6bc1a694a78a82ef": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9b8a520e6bc1a694a78a82ef",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "在晚期NSCLC患者中，肠道微生物组的组成（分类学）和功能（代谢通路）是否与抗PD-1免疫治疗的临床疗效（以PFS衡量）及肿瘤PD-L1表达水平存在显著关联？这些微生物特征能否作为预测治疗反应的生物标志物？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::faf32c1e5ccb77e1a13c852e2498bac77ae1a18a8bf156cf80decfd37ff0d698",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b86a953cd31325f3a920fcc5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b86a953cd31325f3a920fcc5",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "62名接受抗PD-1免疫治疗（ICI）的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者（发现队列），以及60名独立验证队列患者。研究对象为高加索人种，样本来源为粪便微生物组。研究情境包括一线化疗前（CHT-naïve）与后续线化疗后（CHT-treated）的治疗背景，以及伴随使用的抗生素、抗酸药和类固醇药物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3ea459e8ed2dd448a34528cdeb08bb0658bed77ab171de29c47da2fdfa0809b5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::69562d75bc6fc432187b293b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::69562d75bc6fc432187b293b",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探究肠道微生物组特征与非小细胞肺癌患者抗PD-1免疫治疗疗效及PD-L1表达之间的关联。研究团队对62名患者进行了宏基因组测序，分析细菌多样性、分类学组成及代谢通路，并将其与无进展生存期（PFS）、PD-L1免疫组化表达及其他临床参数进行相关性分析。通过多变量统计模型筛选关键预测菌种，并在60人的独立队列中进行验证。同时，利用随机森林机器学习算法评估分类学和代谢通路特征对临床结局的预测能力。研究发现特定细菌物种及其代谢功能可作为ICI疗效和PD-L1状态的生物标志物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::51b44007668fa30483c84a13a1722841ac6a78c025109f20aa01e3b9a7f16368",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::49d9eb67a061fb26ca29b70a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::49d9eb67a061fb26ca29b70a",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤（特别是NSCLC）中免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的具体实证数据。其核心价值在于不仅识别了特定的预测性细菌物种（如Alistipes, Streptococcus），还揭示了代谢通路（如氨基酸合成、发酵）与PD-L1表达的关联，并区分了分类学与功能特征在不同临床终点（PFS vs PD-L1状态）上的预测优势。此外，它还探讨了化疗预处理和辅助药物（抗生素、抗酸药）对微生物组及潜在疗效的影响。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ad654da5d3786493e77220756895a5913b7c6901e1a2d714ea5517fe5b23b86b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fe2e2c8cd6b7b9cbfa3d0132": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fe2e2c8cd6b7b9cbfa3d0132",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限NSCLC患者；观察性关联，非因果证明；基于宏基因组测序，非16S rRNA；主要适用于高加索人群。",
        "contribution": "提供了具体的细菌分类学特征与ICI疗效（PFS）的关联证据。具体包括：长PFS相关的有益菌（Alistipes shahii, A. finegoldii, Barnesiella visceriola）和短PFS相关的有害菌（Streptococcus salivarius, S. vestibularis, Bifidobacterium breve）。证实了Taxonomic profiles在预测PFS方面的有效性（AUC=0.74）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cb30c29b05eee3ff163a564b7b44ea80c87578a4313610492dfc440924b111ca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8bff82d843ab4f555c301908": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8bff82d843ab4f555c301908",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中支持或细化‘哪些特定微生物群与ICI响应相关’的论点。可用作对比不同人群（如东亚vs高加索）微生物特征的案例。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0906d3d6c70577cf4acfa5194d0562cf20a6b7d73bd4807ea39744c219239d03",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::22a0fe6aa2f35eab3a16f5df": {
      "atom_id": "atom::22a0fe6aa2f35eab3a16f5df",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅在37名患者的子集中分析了代谢通路；预测的是PD-L1表达而非直接的治疗响应；需结合其他研究验证代谢通路的普遍性。",
        "contribution": "提供了代谢通路特征与PD-L1表达状态的关联。发现PD-L1低表达患者中核苷酸降解、氨基酸合成和发酵通路更活跃。指出Metabolic pathways在预测PD-L1状态上优于分类学（AUC=0.87）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cb30c29b05eee3ff163a564b7b44ea80c87578a4313610492dfc440924b111ca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::7699ab866259bccf539b3dde": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7699ab866259bccf539b3dde",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于探讨微生物功能特征作为替代生物标志物的潜力，特别是在PD-L1 IHC存在异质性的情况下。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0906d3d6c70577cf4acfa5194d0562cf20a6b7d73bd4807ea39744c219239d03",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::165aa3a3f5f4973cd5c20cec": {
      "atom_id": "atom::165aa3a3f5f4973cd5c20cec",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制主要为推测性讨论，缺乏直接的实验验证（如动物模型或体外实验）；网络分析仅为相关性。",
        "contribution": "提出了微生物组可能通过分子模拟（molecular mimicry）或肠-肺轴影响免疫微环境的背景机制讨论，并观察到长PFS患者中细菌网络更具连通性（hub species如S. vestibularis, B. uniformis等）。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cb30c29b05eee3ff163a564b7b44ea80c87578a4313610492dfc440924b111ca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::874dfafdb9c40ca4e8ec3443": {
      "atom_id": "atom::874dfafdb9c40ca4e8ec3443",
      "source_handle": "P0123",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中讨论潜在的生物学机制假设，特别是微生物网络结构与免疫反应强度的关系。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::76339214318d6dae2602ad367f08f2a99141b2ea07bab66c11cf128e5c7be19c",
