    "atom::9a373b5b5e8e4b7bb0977817": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9a373b5b5e8e4b7bb0977817",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用回顾性队列设计，收集2013年6月至2018年1月间来自四个拉美国家转诊癌症中心的140名成年NSCLC患者数据。根据抗生素使用情况及时间关系将患者分为三组：(1) No-ATB（治疗前及治疗中均未使用抗生素）；(2) Pre-ICI ATB（首次ICI剂量前30天内使用抗生素）；(3) ICI-ATB（ICI治疗期间同步使用抗生素）。主要终点为总生存期（OS），次要终点为无进展生存期（PFS）和治疗反应率。使用Kaplan-Meier法估算生存曲线，并通过Cox回归模型调整潜在混杂因素（如性别、年龄、ECOG评分、ICI类型等）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::64f1a79e98dcd280ae63f740b357b258195dd22f4b7f1f1b68a8a50ce6db0bcf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ed58c8c5c7da47195173c0c8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ed58c8c5c7da47195173c0c8",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "首次在拉丁美洲人群中证实抗生素暴露与ICI治疗NSCLC患者OS缩短之间的关联，补充了全球范围内关于微生物群-免疫治疗相互作用的地域多样性证据。",
        "limits": "回顾性设计存在固有偏倚；样本量较小，特别是抗生素暴露组仅32人，可能限制了对PFS细微差异的检测能力；未直接测量患者微生物群组成，仅以抗生素使用作为间接指标；不同抗生素种类、给药途径和疗程异质性大，难以完全控制为混杂因素。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9a4b2d1d53a074735702e868cc5995140490893df481c5b5814f543270f586c1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f694e44b7f66d3ea76d1afaa": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f694e44b7f66d3ea76d1afaa",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "在140名NSCLC患者中，32名（23%）接受了抗生素治疗（14名为Pre-ICI ATB，18名为ICI-ATB），108名为No-ATB。",
        "finding": "No-ATB组的 median OS 为 40.6个月，而 Pre-ICI ATB 组为 20.3个月，ICI-ATB 组为 24.7个月。抗生素暴露与OS显著缩短相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a3b8c50e749ab2587efcb89a7ff0f610b26264fe47dfc2c4747309f4498e26b1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f881f58de44d36b41861f50f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f881f58de44d36b41861f50f",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "比较不同抗生素暴露组与无暴露组。",
        "finding": "Pre-ICI ATB 与 ICI-ATB 组之间的OS无显著差异（P=0.4）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a3b8c50e749ab2587efcb89a7ff0f610b26264fe47dfc2c4747309f4498e26b1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b8cf8a8436972bfa76303043": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b8cf8a8436972bfa76303043",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "评估PFS和反应率。",
        "finding": "各组间PFS（No-ATB: 2.7个月 vs Pre-ICI: 1.9个月 vs ICI-ATB: 1.9个月）和总体反应率（No-ATB: 26.9% vs ATB组: 25.9%）均无统计学显著差异。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a3b8c50e749ab2587efcb89a7ff0f610b26264fe47dfc2c4747309f4498e26b1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b5c06c97ac53330c5bb984dc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b5c06c97ac53330c5bb984dc",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
