      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9a156fa6780407f62ba286a43ac8a8067acdac463a4817034c89a70b3360357a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b0f2362dd6a743e77723bf99": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b0f2362dd6a743e77723bf99",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "既往研究表明肠道微生物群调节免疫介导的肿瘤细胞破坏，且微生物群改变与ICI疗效降低有关。抗生素作为改变肠道菌群多样性的干预措施，是否会影响ICI的治疗效果？特别是在此前未在拉美人群中验证过这一关联的背景下，抗生素暴露是否与ICI治疗的生存获益受损相关？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b33d110a97b627dcdbbb7a808271b616cdd4b4c53db8f4d0087031a9df226c69",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3584b3a042c0229eed14f3eb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3584b3a042c0229eed14f3eb",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "拉丁美洲（墨西哥、哥伦比亚、哥斯达黎加、秘鲁）晚期或非手术非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2b15796d7d324e92a5746e03e1b513aace8b9de2c30d1e836e25b8252cd14aea",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a3a6055fa8d9cfd30d68ea28": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a3a6055fa8d9cfd30d68ea28",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究是一项多中心跨国回顾性队列研究，旨在评估抗生素治疗（ATB）对接受ICI治疗的拉美裔NSCLC患者临床结局的影响。研究将患者分为三组：无抗生素暴露组、ICI前30天内使用抗生素组以及ICI期间同步使用抗生素组。结果显示，抗生素暴露与总生存期（OS）显著缩短相关，但在无进展生存期（PFS）和客观缓解率上未观察到显著差异。该研究为抗生素通过破坏肠道微生物群进而影响ICI疗效的假说提供了拉美人群的临床证据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9b80af73b67e83f4342e44ae3854cbbac88cb96639aa313bf6dbbeece70c5c82",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8d09044199020a88baff9865": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8d09044199020a88baff9865",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了来自拉丁美洲特定人群的实证数据，支持“抗生素暴露损害ICI疗效”这一假设，但仅限于总生存期（OS），未涉及无进展生存期（PFS）或客观缓解率。它可作为解释地域特异性微生物环境如何影响免疫治疗结果的案例，并提示抗生素选择策略的重要性。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::acd22de6533300277e7db672d711d687a5a59b74a1e6edc2c27a48c4f75e4aec",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a2a99c28ad289dfcd87cdf84": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a2a99c28ad289dfcd87cdf84",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限NSCLC患者；仅关注OS显著性；未提供机制层面的直接证据（如微生物测序）；样本量小，置信区间宽。",
        "contribution": "提供了拉丁美洲NSCLC患者中抗生素暴露与ICI疗效关系的临床观察数据。发现抗生素暴露显著降低OS，但不影响PFS或反应率。这有助于解释在不同地理/人口背景下，微生物群扰动对免疫治疗最终生存结果的影响程度可能不同于其他效应指标。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b6d830c7977381076deb729a9d30eb228f547bb08fc74e992b387031a4e4dd2c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9e2a12f4fe2875fcc444aeb0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9e2a12f4fe2875fcc444aeb0",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中讨论抗生素对ICI疗效影响的异质性，特别是当其他研究（如Derosa等）报告PFS也受影响时，本研究的阴性结果可作为对比，提示研究规模、人群特征或统计效能的差异。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e5835a1f8938c51d2e3dfebd53482ba9fd873af1a5db6374c60359463abde93b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::05940858a54225e623e2f030": {
      "atom_id": "atom::05940858a54225e623e2f030",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制部分是基于文献综述而非本研究原始数据；本研究本身未进行微生物分析；连接点是相关性而非因果证明。",
        "contribution": "虽然未直接阐明机制，但讨论了广谱抗生素（如β-内酰胺类、喹诺酮类）对特定有益菌属（如双歧杆菌、拟杆菌属）的已知破坏作用，并引用文献将这些细菌与IFN-γ水平、树突状细胞成熟和CD8+ T细胞激活联系起来。这为抗生素通过微生物群介导影响ICI疗效提供了理论背景和支持性证据链。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::0d987b52a5da357bdfb14830a31f442c9d69610b3d34b67a50e9213dcf477f30",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b6d830c7977381076deb729a9d30eb228f547bb08fc74e992b387031a4e4dd2c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f50c0b5de56fc761d8e5fc28": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f50c0b5de56fc761d8e5fc28",
      "source_handle": "P0266",
