    },
    "atom::30b573c34d4686f0dde90511": {
      "atom_id": "atom::30b573c34d4686f0dde90511",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用多中心前瞻性队列设计，对175例晚期黑色素瘤患者进行全基因组鸟枪法宏基因组测序（MetaPhlAn4和HuMAnN3）。使用基于Pibble模型的贝叶斯高阶交互回归模型，控制混杂因素（如年龄、性别、BMI、抗生素使用、癌症中心等），模拟PFS ≥12个月与PFS <12个月患者在四个时间点（基线+3次随访）的微生物SGBs和通路的线性轨迹斜率。通过事后对比（post hoc contrasts）比较不同临床亚组（单药vs联合治疗、有无结肠炎、有无PPI使用）中的微生物动态。构建优势比（balance/log ratio）指标，并通过交叉验证和独立队列验证其预测能力。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a3d18379eb4a820d35826f832cbba446019127edef9ad9133878fe71d40139d3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::603dd87d7bd56879846cd0be": {
      "atom_id": "atom::603dd87d7bd56879846cd0be",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了ICB治疗期间肠道微生物组纵向变化的详细图谱，揭示了基线后微生物动态对预后的独立预测价值，并指出了单一基线分析的局限性。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的代谢功能验证实验（如代谢组学关联的具体机制链条）；样本量对于某些亚组分析（如特定药物组合下的结肠炎亚组）较小；将复杂的微生物动态简化为线性轨迹可能忽略非线性变化；独立验证队列样本量有限且异质性大，限制了泛化性的确证强度。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::dd271f12a117a4aa23e9017c2a2586cf4b0ddba0da28eec47931949df8bebbd2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e430a6e48c2d6c2e67dff0c5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e430a6e48c2d6c2e67dff0c5",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "比较PFS ≥12个月与PFS <12个月患者",
        "finding": "99个SGBs能区分两组，其中20个仅在基线有差异，42个仅在治疗后出现差异。5个SGBs（如Agathobaculum butyriciproducens, Intestinibacter bartlettii等）在PFS ≥12组中持续高丰度，主要涉及短链脂肪酸（SCFA）合成；4个SGBs（如Ruthenibacterium lactatiformans, Prevotella copri clade A等）在PFS <12组中持续高丰度。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::85d1bfe13ec7dd25bc26c960adf7776ef34073c137b0395c1bc6ac4d2a3b4f49",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::443fb49c9f3088554cd4d0d0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::443fb49c9f3088554cd4d0d0",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "基于持续差异SGBs构建的对数比率（Balance）",
        "finding": "该平衡指数在基线和早期治疗阶段能有效区分PFS组别（AUC约0.66-0.74），并与总生存期（OS）显著相关（HR > 1.6, P < 0.05）。在部分独立验证队列中显示出可比的预测能力。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::85d1bfe13ec7dd25bc26c960adf7776ef34073c137b0395c1bc6ac4d2a3b4f49",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8938ae105f66f17f21386d2a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8938ae105f66f17f21386d2a",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "不同临床情境：治疗方案",
        "finding": "单药与联合治疗共享部分微生物信号，但部分SGBs（如Coprococcus eutactus）在两种方案下对PFS的预测方向相反。单药治疗中，某些拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）在PFS <12组中增加，而在联合治疗中未观察到此现象。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::85d1bfe13ec7dd25bc26c960adf7776ef34073c137b0395c1bc6ac4d2a3b4f49",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::48f055c5be701277f3632d37": {
      "atom_id": "atom::48f055c5be701277f3632d37",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "不同临床情境：ICB诱导的结肠炎",
        "finding": "未发生结肠炎的患者中丁酸产生菌（如Roseburia, Faecalibacterium prausnitzii）丰度较高或下降较少。发生结肠炎的患者中，Akkermansia muciniphila基线高但随后急剧下降。基于结肠炎相关SGBs构建的平衡指数可预测结肠炎发生（AUC ~0.72）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::85d1bfe13ec7dd25bc26c960adf7776ef34073c137b0395c1bc6ac4d2a3b4f49",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::86e5be2fda48fb97bb33a867": {
      "atom_id": "atom::86e5be2fda48fb97bb33a867",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "不同临床情境：PPI使用",
        "finding": "PPI使用者与非使用者在微生物动态上存在差异，例如Streptococcus thermophilus在非使用者（PFS ≥12）中增加，而在使用者中减少。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "4"
          ]
        }
      ],
