      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a6407bd9a8727b0dd8ffac8b07f6629e2025514d05800b769452324752ee1474",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::05f79046a45347941b8a0e97": {
      "atom_id": "atom::05f79046a45347941b8a0e97",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "既往基于基线的横断面研究在识别ICB疗效相关的微生物生物标志物时存在异质性和缺乏共识。本研究试图回答：在ICB治疗过程中，肠道微生物组如何随时间动态变化？这些纵向动态是否能比基线数据更准确地预测患者的无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS），以及这些动态是否受治疗方案和副作用等临床因素的调节？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a24b85c97a4d00c692ef18b77ed1e7c662a7c1a21235f256d5e62a0e02c1caa1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8c0d9cf452b7f1f00a10ae1e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8c0d9cf452b7f1f00a10ae1e",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "针对接受免疫检查点阻断（ICB）治疗的晚期黑色素瘤患者，进行纵向肠道微生物组分析。研究涉及来自英国、荷兰和西班牙五个队列的175名患者，样本采集覆盖治疗前基线及治疗后12周内的三个时间点。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5498b009c700282e8f165a51c355db813d24adc3bdb84a5a477118e83c13ab65",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1c4da8832cf0501356004535": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1c4da8832cf0501356004535",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在解决既往横断面研究中微生物标志物缺乏共识的问题，通过纵向追踪ICB治疗期间肠道微生物组的动态变化，区分长期无进展生存（PFS ≥12个月）与短期生存患者的微生物特征。研究利用贝叶斯回归模型分析物种水平基因组箱（SGBs）和代谢通路的丰度轨迹，并考察不同临床情境（如治疗方案、结肠炎发生、质子泵抑制剂使用）对微生物动态的影响。研究发现，除了基线差异外，许多微生物在治疗后的丰度变化模式具有预测价值，且同一微生物在不同临床背景下可能呈现相反的动态趋势。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0196f668a5b4d2f44fa9cf2c2286bf66cc63ff09cd3f2f436af54d7fdb4e0120",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7a6b8e139382696c84494af7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7a6b8e139382696c84494af7",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了ICB治疗期间肠道微生物组纵向演变的实证数据，特别强调了‘治疗后动态’相对于‘基线静态’的预测价值。它为综述提供了关于微生物群落如何响应免疫治疗的时间维度证据，以及不同临床背景（药物类型、副作用、合并用药）如何重塑这种响应的具体案例。可用于支持‘微生物组动态监测优于单次基线检测’的观点，并为解释不同研究中微生物标志物不一致的现象提供情境化解释。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::180ae9e2898326643c1d4f6a16c18db68987a3d48b6352f95b96e36ed7455b4e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::43396f6bd89fcfe547c798f6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::43396f6bd89fcfe547c798f6",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限于晚期黑色素瘤人群；结果依赖于特定的SGB定义和贝叶斯模型假设；独立验证队列规模有限，需谨慎外推至其他肿瘤类型或更大人群。",
        "contribution": "提供了175例晚期黑色素瘤患者纵向队列中，与长期无进展生存（PFS ≥12个月）相关的特定微生物SGBs及其代谢通路（主要是SCFA合成）的动态变化证据。识别出5种持续高丰度的有益菌和4种持续高丰度的潜在耐药菌。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5981b49e2e7f8eb57ab60100f87f9892ca7038bb6a36649829f072dd76bada4b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::4ae2b7d657c90b14d81fe843": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4ae2b7d657c90b14d81fe843",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“哪些微生物特征与ICB疗效相关”的子问题，特别是强调治疗过程中的动态积累效应。可作为支持SCFA产生菌在ICB疗效中作用的实证素材。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4006f7b8784c712af44c0f3903860393766970f11566a250cf8e45beb0092836",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::4744a172e9d399d50b4334de": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4744a172e9d399d50b4334de",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这是观察性关联，不能直接证明因果关系；亚组样本量较小，统计效力受限；结论主要基于统计学上的斜率差异，而非直接的生物学机制验证。",
        "contribution": "展示了同一微生物在不同临床情境（单药vs联合治疗、有无结肠炎、PPI使用）下表现出截然不同的丰度轨迹，甚至出现相反的方向性。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5981b49e2e7f8eb57ab60100f87f9892ca7038bb6a36649829f072dd76bada4b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::406208dc4b04b966354640ea": {
      "atom_id": "atom::406208dc4b04b966354640ea",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释综述中可能存在的异质性来源，说明为何不同研究或不同患者群体中观察到的微生物标志物不同。提示在评估微生物疗效时需考虑临床协变量。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4006f7b8784c712af44c0f3903860393766970f11566a250cf8e45beb0092836",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a2b75c2240feb44595c22eb9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a2b75c2240feb44595c22eb9",
      "source_handle": "P0033",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "文章主要基于宏基因组的功能潜力预测（MetaCyc pathways），而非实测代谢物浓度；机制解释多为推测性，需结合其他实验研究确认因果链条；所给材料未提供直接的免疫细胞浸润或功能验证数据。",
        "contribution": "提出了微生物动态与宿主免疫反应（通过irAEs如结肠炎体现）及代谢产物（SCFA, polyamines, menaquinol）之间的潜在联系。例如，发现丁酸产生菌与避免结肠炎相关，多胺合成途径与PFS ≥12相关。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::80b33fd7b89d6836b1f0d00c8597fd6d579fb8da4ac0b2d58de541e9da29b063",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5981b49e2e7f8eb57ab60100f87f9892ca7038bb6a36649829f072dd76bada4b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
