        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5b0537fa2a762d7197fb79b308905d19cc76f054e586c25f05281495a3a2fded",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8929e2461a625ffd972c1f1d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8929e2461a625ffd972c1f1d",
      "source_handle": "P0517",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已有研究表明肠道菌群失调可能通过抗生素使用负面影响实体瘤的ICI疗效，但这种效应在NSCLC中是否适用尚不明确。此外，抗生素对ICI疗效的影响是否依赖于肿瘤的PD-L1表达状态，也是本研究试图解决的关键问题。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66a75b407fbfabec9a6931d8d7e41fbed3adcf34984036faec1b0db7293647c3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::22e8beaa1aee1184601de1542a89a2513e7ce18364f343b539f2725b1e5ea4df",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::44acf6f0993c180b277e882b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::44acf6f0993c180b277e882b",
      "source_handle": "P0517",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）单药治疗（抗PD-1或抗PD-L1），研究抗生素使用对预后的影响，并按PD-L1表达水平分层。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66a75b407fbfabec9a6931d8d7e41fbed3adcf34984036faec1b0db7293647c3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0964286513efc1806d5d91cdc975d3c7c29a4b00f59300fcfe39039ab7337c30",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7b782a7bbdc86f90d034e5cf": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7b782a7bbdc86f90d034e5cf",
      "source_handle": "P0517",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在探讨抗生素使用对NSCLC患者ICI疗效的影响，并特别关注这种影响是否因肿瘤PD-L1表达水平的不同而存在差异。研究回顾性分析了9家医疗机构在2015年12月至2018年5月期间收治的531名接受ICI单药治疗的NSCLC患者数据。通过Kaplan-Meier法和Cox比例风险模型，比较了在使用ICI前后两个月内使用抗生素与未使用抗生素患者的无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）。结果显示，整体人群中抗生素使用显著缩短OS，但不影响PFS；进一步分析发现，这种负面影响主要集中在PD-L1高表达（≥50%）的患者亚组中，而在低表达（<50%）亚组中未见显著影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66a75b407fbfabec9a6931d8d7e41fbed3adcf34984036faec1b0db7293647c3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::957d1d7e9e901e0d067762041f601470b2da683aef7c44ece90f727e2b3bbaa9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::5ce414c6126383fd255d36e3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5ce414c6126383fd255d36e3",
      "source_handle": "P0517",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道菌群/抗生素干预如何调节免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的重要临床观察证据。其核心价值在于指出了这种调节作用并非普遍一致，而是高度依赖于宿主的生物标志物状态（此处为PD-L1表达水平）。这为理解“为什么某些患者受抗生素负面影响而另一些不受影响”提供了关键的临床分层视角，有助于细化综述中关于效应异质性的讨论。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66a75b407fbfabec9a6931d8d7e41fbed3adcf34984036faec1b0db7293647c3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f8fa027e591c6747fb932708ad082123836d71ce4fa171362b32eab407edad02",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a9466e6e4f86238372b2a724": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a9466e6e4f86238372b2a724",
      "source_handle": "P0517",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限于NSCLC人群；仅评估ICI单药治疗；未直接测量肠道菌群变化，而是通过抗生素使用作为菌群扰动的代理指标。",
        "contribution": "提供了抗生素使用对NSCLC患者ICI疗效影响的实证数据，证实了负面效应的存在，并量化了其对OS和PFS的具体影响幅度。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66a75b407fbfabec9a6931d8d7e41fbed3adcf34984036faec1b0db7293647c3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d43070d221f5aae021427c20aaaeee8b5349df0a3b4f66933fc081f9699904b1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c418ac4547170bcc8ea5f537": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c418ac4547170bcc8ea5f537",
      "source_handle": "P0517",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于支持综述中关于“抗生素使用通常与较差的ICI预后相关”这一观点的证据链，特别是针对肺癌这一主要适应症。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66a75b407fbfabec9a6931d8d7e41fbed3adcf34984036faec1b0db7293647c3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2c569f657d00e79ad916ba4918bb90b36ab47b68a589fca5298974bdaa9d65da",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::57e0f2f337bc31f45e7a85ed": {
      "atom_id": "atom::57e0f2f337bc31f45e7a85ed",
      "source_handle": "P0517",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这是观察性关联，不能直接推断因果机制；PD-L1阈值（50%）的选择可能影响结果的普适性；需确认其他研究中是否有类似的分层发现以验证此特异性。",
        "contribution": "揭示了PD-L1高表达（≥50%）是抗生素负面效应的关键预测因子，而在低表达人群中未发现显著影响。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66a75b407fbfabec9a6931d8d7e41fbed3adcf34984036faec1b0db7293647c3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d43070d221f5aae021427c20aaaeee8b5349df0a3b4f66933fc081f9699904b1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a5d76b419a7abdcb430d3713": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a5d76b419a7abdcb430d3713",
      "source_handle": "P0517",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释ICI疗效受微生物组干预影响的异质性来源。提示在综述中讨论宿主因素（如PD-L1状态）如何与微生物组状态交互作用，从而决定治疗结局。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66a75b407fbfabec9a6931d8d7e41fbed3adcf34984036faec1b0db7293647c3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2c569f657d00e79ad916ba4918bb90b36ab47b68a589fca5298974bdaa9d65da",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::92fb0c19f2f50389af05e882": {
      "atom_id": "atom::92fb0c19f2f50389af05e882",
      "source_handle": "P0517",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "本研究的观察性质决定了它无法区分是PD-L1本身导致了敏感性，还是与PD-L1相关的其他因素（如肿瘤负荷、既往治疗史）所致。不能据此断定具体的分子机制。",
        "contribution": "虽然未直接阐明分子机制，但其发现的PD-L1依赖性效应为机制假说提供了约束条件。例如，它暗示高PD-L1表达可能与特定的肠道菌群组成或免疫微环境状态相关联，使得这些患者对菌群扰动更为敏感。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66a75b407fbfabec9a6931d8d7e41fbed3adcf34984036faec1b0db7293647c3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::8e39696d5d023f2a0efe55a9c58160e9abfabc5813cab5426b654cc008eba9c7",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
