    "atom::cf0e818c904ac17053a345ff": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cf0e818c904ac17053a345ff",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用观察性队列设计，纳入两项前瞻性临床试验（J1772和J1414）的患者。数据收集包括：1. 基线及治疗期间连续采集的粪便样本；2. 使用16S rRNA扩增子测序进行微生物组分析；3. 记录临床结局，特别是主要病理缓解（MPR，定义为切除肿瘤标本中存活肿瘤≤10%）。分析方法包括：比较基线Alpha多样性（Simpson倒数指数）在MPR与非MPR组间的差异；利用Bootstrap分析从治疗开始至180天计算个体样本中前10种共有细菌物种的“自相似性”得分并关联结局；使用DESeq进行功能分析以识别与微生物组变化相关的代谢通路。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::16ef3d4177188c424f52b8f807153b6a90e2ab15cfe35e53d6618f1330a6c4e7",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::38327915c3ef65f1f59c2da6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::38327915c3ef65f1f59c2da6",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了早期NSCLC新辅助ICI治疗背景下，肠道微生物组特征（低基线多样性、高纵向稳定性、SCFA相关通路富集）与良好病理缓解（MPR）之间关联的证据。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的统计校正方法（如多重检验校正）、混杂因素控制情况、不同ICI方案（单药vs联合vs联合放疗/化疗）对结果的潜在影响分层分析，以及样本量较小（n=23）带来的统计效力限制。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4718440e936a1ad53030e8f779299c9fe23881b5b46edc6fa43d8699ef041f90",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1665946e8aef50017746dddf": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1665946e8aef50017746dddf",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "早期可切除NSCLC患者，新辅助ICI治疗，基于16S rRNA测序的基线Alpha多样性测量",
        "finding": "达到MPR的患者基线Alpha多样性显著低于未达到MPR的患者（11.1 vs 19.5, p=0.02）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::029d66e11ca1eb7d6655e62d31f4c206b980e9cd90be02f45f8a1868a78983de",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6c666b25e61de53a0506409c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6c666b25e61de53a0506409c",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "新辅助ICI治疗期间纵向监测，基于Bootstrap分析的微生物组“自相似性”得分",
        "finding": "达到MPR的患者在治疗180天时表现出更高的微生物组自相似性（稳定性），显著高于无MPR患者（96.1% vs 92.1%, p=0.001）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::029d66e11ca1eb7d6655e62d31f4c206b980e9cd90be02f45f8a1868a78983de",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::1eb4aafa3ffac84f91bf911e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1eb4aafa3ffac84f91bf911e",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "基于DESeq的功能分析，比较MPR与非MPR组的代谢通路丰度",
        "finding": "与短链脂肪酸（SCFA）产生相关的代谢通路在MPR患者中更为丰富。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
