      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8d0fe6ca31f6eacced2def34": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8d0fe6ca31f6eacced2def34",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "接受新辅助免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的早期可切除非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者；涉及两项前瞻性临床试验（J1772, J1414）的队列。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::621685fbbfc2096316908be314c7120e324c01978cc0963417da433db2c0588f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::00ea803d77a6f0246ba70920": {
      "atom_id": "atom::00ea803d77a6f0246ba70920",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在探讨基线肠道微生物组（GM）特征及纵向变化与NSCLC患者新辅助ICI治疗反应之间的关系。既往研究多关注晚期NSCLC，而本研究的背景是早期阶段患者的关联尚不明确。研究团队收集了患者的粪便样本进行16S rRNA扩增子测序，分析基线微生物组特征以及治疗期间的纵向变化，并将其与主要病理缓解（MPR）这一临床结局指标相关联。通过Bootstrap分析计算“自相似性”得分以评估纵向稳定性，并使用DESeq进行功能分析以阐明相关的代谢通路。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9ad80872aa5bbd27b8bee916a015a003e66c25f21adee6bc53b8d131b56b591a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::edc951ee022e6076aa83aeee": {
      "atom_id": "atom::edc951ee022e6076aa83aeee",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于早期NSCLC新辅助免疫治疗中肠道微生物组与疗效关联的具体实证数据。其核心价值在于揭示了不同于晚期NSCLC某些研究的基线多样性模式（此处为低多样性与好预后相关），并引入了纵向稳定性（自相似性）作为预测指标，同时指出了SCFA代谢通路的可能机制角色。这些发现可用于综述中讨论不同疾病阶段（早期vs晚期）或治疗场景（新辅助vs晚期一线）下微生物组标志物的异质性，以及微生物组动态变化而非仅基线状态的重要性。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::73c9a0e866cc134162389f518a51d20080d7017494c1f9593dff87e04a0de91a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a7bcf65d2d78fd39792bf20d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a7bcf65d2d78fd39792bf20d",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限早期可切除NSCLC的新辅助治疗场景；样本量较小；主要关联而非因果证明；未区分具体ICI药物组合的影响。",
        "contribution": "提供了早期NSCLC新辅助ICI治疗中，特定微生物组特征（低基线Alpha多样性、高纵向稳定性、SCFA通路富集）与较好治疗反应（MPR）正相关的证据。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e9980c641db3d7feb3774bccdb1a1609dded297120a4c0fabd9b3ce55f0e37b9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c94d01e6eaa4f389eef911b5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c94d01e6eaa4f389eef911b5",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于支持或细化综述中关于“哪些微生物组特征预示ICI疗效”的论述，特别是针对早期/新辅助场景，可与晚期NSCLC或其他瘤种的研究结果进行对比，展示情境依赖性。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3ec14e06991a431eba4b4a5ef4bcb43652dddeb70f149eb5e5c32820d02aef09",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d73035d76945fb89e4bcc339": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d73035d76945fb89e4bcc339",
      "source_handle": "P0569",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅为相关性发现，未直接验证因果关系；功能分析基于16S测序推断，分辨率有限；未深入探讨SCFA如何具体调节抗肿瘤免疫反应。",
        "contribution": "提示短链脂肪酸（SCFA）产生相关的代谢通路可能与更好的治疗反应有关，为微生物组调节免疫治疗效应的潜在机制提供了线索。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2c10f66e656b13b1d08f07b21f5974af1eb5f51d99874e2c3d45338c713e4ade",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e9980c641db3d7feb3774bccdb1a1609dded297120a4c0fabd9b3ce55f0e37b9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c15d9745ec8f029c8a0ec00f": {
